  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 3329151135744
    m_Localized: Fuel Tax
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135745
    m_Localized: Imposes a tax on all vehicle fuels sold within the country. This
      reduces overall traffic density and generates significant revenue for transport
      infrastructure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135746
    m_Localized: Road Toll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135747
    m_Localized: Requires drivers to pay fees for using major highways and roads.
      This funding is directly reinvested into road maintenance and repairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135748
    m_Localized: Vehicle Tax
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135749
    m_Localized: An annual tax levied on the ownership of private and commercial
      vehicles. Higher rates can discourage citizens from buying emission-heavy cars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135750
    m_Localized: Airport Tax
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135751
    m_Localized: Charges an additional tax on air travel tickets and commercial flights.
      It helps offset the environmental impact of aviation and funds green initiatives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135752
    m_Localized: Parking Fees
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135753
    m_Localized: Implements paid parking zones in public spaces and city centers.
      This revenue flows directly into municipal budgets and regulates town traffic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135754
    m_Localized: Road Infrastructure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135755
    m_Localized: Provides extensive funding for the construction and modernization
      of roads and highways. Proper maintenance improves safety and speeds up supply
      chains.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135756
    m_Localized: Rail Network
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135757
    m_Localized: Allocates national funds to expand and maintain railway infrastructure.
      A robust rail network shifts cargo from highways to eco-friendly train transport.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135758
    m_Localized: Public Transit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135759
    m_Localized: Provides financial subsidies to make public transport affordable
      and accessible for everyone. High adoption drastically reduces urban traffic
      congestion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135760
    m_Localized: Cycling Infrastructure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3329151135761
    m_Localized: Invests in building and connecting dedicated cycling paths across
      cities. This encourages a healthier lifestyle and offers a clean alternative
      to driving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
